window.questions=[{"id": "q001", "number": 1, "original_number": "2-19", "body": "设有源网络如图 2-15 所示，试求传递函数 $U_o(s)/U_i(s)$。", "paragraphs": [], "figure": {"number": "2-15", "caption": "有源网络电路图", "svg": "assets/fig-2-15.svg", "pdf": "assets/fig-2-15.pdf"}}, {"id": "q002", "number": 2, "original_number": "2-27", "body": "试简化图 2-28 所示系统结构图，并求出相应的传递函数 $C(s)/R(s)$ 和 $C(s)/N(s)$。", "paragraphs": [], "figure": {"number": "2-28", "caption": "系统结构图", "svg": "assets/fig-2-28.svg", "pdf": "assets/fig-2-28.pdf"}}, {"id": "q003", "number": 3, "original_number": "2-29", "body": "已知描述系统的微分方程组如下所述。试分别用方框图表示各方程式，并由此绘制每个系统的结构图。若 $r$ 表示系统输入量，$n$ 表示系统所受到的扰动，$c$ 表示系统的输出量，试由各系统结构图分别求出传递函数 $C(s)/R(s)$ 及 $C(s)/N(s)$。", "paragraphs": ["(1) $c(t)=x_1(t)+K_3r(t)$", "$\\dot{x}_1(t)=-T_1x_1(t)+x_2(t)+K_2r(t),\\quad \\dot{x}_2(t)=-T_2x_1(t)+K_1r(t)$", "其中，$x_1(t)$ 和 $x_2(t)$ 为中间变量；$K_1,K_2,K_3,T_1$ 和 $T_2$ 均为常数。", "(2) $x_1(t)=K[r(t)-c(t)],\\quad x_2(t)=\\tau\\dot{r}(t)$", "$\\dot{x}_3(t)=x_1(t)+x_2(t)-x_3(t)$", "$T\\dot{x}_4(t)=x_3(t)-x_4(t)+x_5(t),\\quad c(t)=x_4(t)+n(t)$", "$x_5(t)=T\\dot{n}(t)+n(t)$", "其中，$x_1(t),x_2(t),x_3(t),x_4(t)$ 和 $x_5(t)$ 为中间变量；$K,\\tau$ 和 $T$ 均为常数。"], "figure": null}, {"id": "q004", "number": 4, "original_number": "2-51", "body": "系统结构图如图 2-100 所示，试用结构图变换的方法求传递函数 $E(s)/R(s)$。", "paragraphs": [], "figure": {"number": "2-100", "caption": "系统结构图", "svg": "assets/fig-2-100.svg", "pdf": "assets/fig-2-100.pdf"}}, {"id": "q005", "number": 5, "original_number": "2-52", "body": "设系统的脉冲响应函数为", "paragraphs": ["$g(t)=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{ll}5e^{-t},&t\\geq 0,\\\\0,&t<0.\\end{array}\\right.$", "系统输入量 $r(t)$ 的形式如图 2-104 所示。试求该系统在 $r(t)$ 作用下的输出表达式 $c(t)$，并画出 $c(t)$ 的大致图形。"], "figure": {"number": "2-104", "caption": "系统输入量图形", "svg": "assets/fig-2-104.svg", "pdf": "assets/fig-2-104.pdf"}}, {"id": "q006", "number": 6, "original_number": "2-60", "body": "某系统动态结构图如图 2-123 所示，$R(s)$ 为输入量，$N(s)$ 为扰动量，$C(s)$ 为输出量。试求系统总输出 $C(s)$ 的表达式。", "paragraphs": [], "figure": {"number": "2-123", "caption": "系统结构图", "svg": "assets/fig-2-123.svg", "pdf": "assets/fig-2-123.pdf"}}, {"id": "q007", "number": 7, "original_number": "2-61", "body": "系统结构图如图 2-124 所示，试求传递函数 $C(s)/R(s)$。", "paragraphs": [], "figure": {"number": "2-124", "caption": "系统结构图", "svg": "assets/fig-2-124.svg", "pdf": "assets/fig-2-124.pdf"}}, {"id": "q008", "number": 8, "original_number": "2-31", "body": "试求图 2-44 所示系统的输出 $C_1(s)$ 及 $C_2(s)$ 的表达式。", "paragraphs": [], "figure": {"number": "2-44", "caption": null, "svg": "assets/fig-2-44.png", "pdf": "assets/fig-2-44.pdf"}}];